// Module 11 · Accessible product design. Guided practice authored against each
// lesson's own steps, outputs, criteria and misconception
// (docs/BEGINNER-LESSON-AUDIT.md). Two rules from the module carry into every
// worksheet here: nothing depends on a purchase, and every claim is bounded by
// who did the checking. A sighted designer running preliminary checks produces
// something real and much smaller than testing with disabled people, so each
// lesson keeps those two apart in the interface rather than only in prose.
