          tradeoff: 'Grouping the date boxes means the group name is announced before each of the three, which is more words than a sighted reader needs. That repetition is the cost of the boxes making sense at all.',
          uncertainty: 'Still unknown: whether the group name reads well when announced, or whether it is too long. That needs the listening lesson and a real build.',
